</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/809d487a-98a7-11f1-91b9-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26226242888783-1.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/809d487a-98a7-11f1-91b9-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26226242888783-1.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">990acc20-98a7-11f1-85da-6ff6e64a341c</guid><pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 12:54:18 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/809d487a-98a7-11f1-91b9-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26226242888783-1.jpg">© 美联社图片</source><dc:creator>弗林</dc:creator></item><item><category>微言微语</category><title>北漂啊北漂，如今北京却留不住年轻人了</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%B8%93%E6%A0%8F%E6%A3%80%E7%B4%A2/%E5%BE%AE%E8%A8%80%E5%BE%AE%E8%AF%AD/20260815-%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E5%B9%B4%E8%BD%BB%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%A3%E6%95%B0%E5%8D%81%E5%B9%B4%E5%A4%A7%E5%87%8F%E4%B8%80%E5%8D%8A-%E4%B8%BA%E4%BD%95%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E7%95%99%E4%B8%8D%E4%BD%8F%E5%B9%B4%E8%BD%BB%E4%BA%BA</link><description>
